description:
Redirects to Threads wiki and other product specific destinations.
      `p92 or p92 dash` - go to Threads executive dashbaord;
      `p92 goal or p92 goals` - go to Threads H2 2024 goals dashboard;
      `p92 <blah> - search <blah> Threads wiki.

Redirects to Threads wiki and other product specific destinations.
      `p92 or p92 dash` - go to Threads executive dashbaord;
      `p92 goal or p92 goals` - go to Threads H2 2024 goals dashboard;
      `p92 <blah> - search <blah> Threads wiki.

Redirects to IG Notifications wiki and team specific destinations.
      `ign` - go to wiki.
      `ign dash` - go to holdout dashbaord;
      `ign launches` - go to launche tracker dash;
      `ign exp` - go to experiment sheet;
      `ign sev` - go to open SEVs;
      `ign cap` - go to open capacity runbook;
      `ign file sev` - file a SEV with the right tag and impacted area;
      `ign console` - go to IGN Console;
      `ign support - go to IG Notifications Eng Q&A Support Form;
      `ign <blah> - search <blah> on wiki.

Usage: xruuid <uuid>. Redirect to ID page, or spit out "Not Found" page;
Note: for LNode, uuid refers to uuid:realse_version;
    if no specified realse version, default realse version will be used.

Redirects to IG Growth wiki and team specific destinations.
      `iggr` - go to wiki.
      `iggr dash` - go to dashbaord;
      `iggr sev` - go to open SEVs;
      `iggr <blah> - search <blah> on wiki.
